=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# backup status-row --------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock (decision 1, alternative (b)): one status row of the$
# screen's own, the state, in place of the frame's two copied$
# rows, the section keeping the path; on the default host.$
$
# Backup Settings ##############################################$
$
  [+] Backups              Enabled$
$
# Backup Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Backup Path          /var/backups/hardn Not created yet$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Backup State         Turn backups off$
   2) Backup Path          Change backup path$
   3) Verify Directory     Check the path, writing nothing$
   4) Backup Runs          None yet$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-4 or q]:$
$
$

